docs {
  # Gets the latest process grouping config.

  Returns the latest process grouping config in cbor format. Passing the kubernetes cluster id will return the cluster config, otherwise config is read on environment level.

  **Auth:** OAuth (inherited from collection)

  **Required OAuth scopes:** `environment-api:deployment:download`, `fleet-management:oneagents:download`

  **API token scopes:** InstallerDownload
}
